Package: GvizRegulatoryTracks
Type: Package
Title: Score-Scaled Sequence and Motif Logo Tracks for Gviz
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Froehlich", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jonathan@example.com")
Author: Jonathan Froehlich [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jonathan Froehlich <jonathan@example.com>
URL: https://github.com/jjfroehlich/GvizRegulatoryTracks
BugReports: https://github.com/jjfroehlich/GvizRegulatoryTracks/issues
Description: Adds Grid-based Gviz custom tracks for signed, base-resolution
    nucleotide scores and genomic motif logos. Score tracks scale each
    nucleotide by its value and delegate overview rendering to Gviz DataTrack,
    while motif tracks place strand-aware information-content logos at genomic
    motif matches.
